ℹ The standard library is a Rust crate — `FileSystem.Read(...)` becomes `FileSystem::read(...)` and `use vbr_stdlib::…;` is added for you.
ℹ Vinyl names are their lowercase self in Rust — e.g. `ReadFile` becomes `readfile`. (Functions and variables lowercase, constants uppercase; shown once.)
ℹ GetOpenFilename / GetSaveAsFilename / GetFolderName pick a path (empty string if cancelled). On a Screen they overlay the terminal; on a Window they open the OS dialog.